From b53c7ac6e22a1dccc5748adb902276d103a1cef2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: richard-rhino <richard-rhino@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:57:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Spec decode: give each drafted token the KV blocks up to its
 own position

A multi-token decode step gave every token the block list of the request's
first token. A drafted token that opened a new KV block was then computed
without that block and with the previous block mostly masked, so it lost its
context. Single-token steps are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: richard-rhino <richard-rhino@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../unit_tests/worker/test_decode_token_padding.py  | 10 ++++++++--
 vllm_gaudi/v1/worker/decode_token_padding.py        |  8 ++++++++
 vllm_gaudi/v1/worker/hpu_model_runner.py            | 13 +++++++------
 3 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

